{"channelId":"UCjISfp5zGQYW3R4HpTs2iTw","row":["Viktor Larkhill",1030000,"We rescue critically injured animals who have run out of options.\n\nI’m Viktor Larkhill, founder of Let’s Adopt International. We specialize in Extreme Rescue: complex cases requiring advanced veterinary medicine, surgery, rehabilitation and long-term care.\n\nOn this channel, you will see the entire journey, from rescue and diagnosis to recovery at the Great House and, whenever possible, the extraordinary home waiting at the end.\n\nThese are real animals, real medical decisions and real second chances. We document the truth because rescue does not end when the camera stops.\n\nSubscribe and become part of the international community making these rescues possible.\n\nFor deeper updates and to help us keep saving lives, join Let’s Adopt on Patreon through the link below.\nhttps://www.patreon.com/LetsAdopt","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjISfp5zGQYW3R4HpTs2iTw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjISfp5zGQYW3R4HpTs2iTw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:10.558Z","channelId":"UCjISfp5zGQYW3R4HpTs2iTw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d1d2666dda51bae757dceacc23b766e80c9c5a1222cfa87cdaab06f1c577bc86","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7726efdfaf5e75f8ea22661cc05b53b4cf487887cd7b35c67c7de3e6f62af6d7"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjISfp5zGQYW3R4HpTs2iTw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:01:26.977Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjISfp5zGQYW3R4HpTs2iTw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1030000,"raw":"1.03M subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjISfp5zGQYW3R4HpTs2iTw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:10.558Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":